{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01GSU5yTWetiKbTV8imHr4gC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntiers:\n  best:\n    meaning: \"CLIP-ViT 控制实验确认 VL pretraining 是关键因子，LIBERO-Spatial 复现核心排序，三条 Claim 全强度成立\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"CLIP-ViT RSA 落入 SigLIP 附近 (0.50-0.60)，证明 VL pretraining 通用有效而非 SigLIP 特异性\"\n      - \"LIBERO-Spatial 保持 SigLIP > VLA > DINO 排序，effect size 在 LIBERO-Goal 的 ±15% 内\"\n      - \"训练不变性在 LIBERO-Spatial 复现 (bootstrap CI includes 0)\"\n      - \"Geometric-functional dissociation (DINO ≈ Proj in R², RSA gap 0.23) 被接受为方法论贡献\"\n      - \"Reviewer 接受 single-architecture scope + CKA-RSA dissociation 作为正面发现\"\n    number_ranges:\n      clip_vit_rsa: [0.50, 0.60]\n      libero_spatial_siglip_rsa: [0.55, 0.65]\n      libero_spatial_training_delta_p: [0.10, 1.00]  # p>0.10 即不显著，复现不变性\n      libero_spatial_readout_delta: [0.030, 0.060]    # 类似 LIBERO-Goal 的 0.045\n      reviewer_score_median: [6, 8]                    # CoRL 1-10 scale\n    narrative_direction: >\n      原始 framing 完全成立。三条 Claim 无需调整：(1) Vision encoder dominance 泛化至 VL-pretrained encoder 族，\n      CLIP-ViT 作为独立验证消除 SigLIP-specific confound；(2) LLM geometric degradation + readout\n      concentration 跨 benchmark 复现；(3) Routing-without-creating 在两个 benchmark 上均成立。\n      CKA-RSA dissociation 升格为第四个 finding（geometric vs global structure 分离）。\n      标题可用 \"Where Do Actions Come From?\" 的强叙事。\n\n  median:\n    meaning: \"CLIP-ViT 结果存在 confound 但可控，LIBERO-Spatial 未完成或部分复现，需软化 Claim 1 并加限定词\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"CLIP-ViT RSA 落入中间地带 (0.42-0.50)：高于 DINO 但显著低于 SigLIP，VL pretraining 有贡献但 SigLIP 有额外优势\"\n      - \"LIBERO-Spatial 未在 deadline 前完成，或排序保持但 effect size 缩小 30-50%\"\n      - \"Claim 2/3 的 readout concentration (Δ=0.045, p<0.0001) 不受影响——这是最强证据\"\n      - \"至少一位 reviewer 质疑 single-architecture + single-benchmark 泛化性\"\n      - \"CKA-RSA dissociation 被一位 reviewer 视为 metric confusion 而非 finding\"\n    number_ranges:\n      clip_vit_rsa: [0.42, 0.50]\n      libero_spatial_siglip_rsa: [0.45, 0.58]         # 如做了但 effect 偏小\n      libero_spatial_training_delta_p: [0.03, 0.15]    # 边缘，可能显著可能不显著\n      libero_spatial_readout_delta: [0.015, 0.035]     # 方向对但 effect 更小\n      reviewer_score_median: [4, 6]                     # borderline\n    narrative_direction: >\n      Claim 1 从 \"vision encoder dominance\" 软化为 \"VL-pretrained vision encoder dominance,\n      with SigLIP showing strongest alignment\"——承认 encoder choice 影响 geometric alignment\n      程度，但核心论点（action structure 源自 frozen encoder 而非 LLM fine-tuning）不变。\n      Claim 2/3 保持原强度，readout concentration 作为 headline result 前置。\n      补充 CLIP-ViT 作为 partial control（VL pretraining > self-supervised，但 encoder 间差异存在）。\n      Discussion 增加 \"pretraining recipe matters\" 一段。论文重心从 \"where actions come from\"\n      微调为 \"what fine-tuning actually learns\"——以 Claim 3 (routing-not-creating) 为核心卖点，\n      Claim 1 降为支撑性 finding。Rebuttal 准备 LIBERO-Spatial 初步结果或 promise。\n\n  worst:\n    meaning: \"CLIP-ViT 打破 VL-pretraining 解释（RSA ≈ DINO 或 RSA > SigLIP），核心 framing 需重构\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"CLIP-ViT RSA < 0.42（接近 DINO 0.388）：VL pretraining 不是充分条件，SigLIP 的 geometric alignment 来自其特定训练配方而非 VL pretraining 大类\"\n      - \"或 CLIP-ViT RSA > 0.60（> SigLIP）：说明 geometric alignment 与下游 action performance 脱钩，undermines RSA 作为核心 metric 的 validity\"\n      - \"LIBERO-Spatial 排序反转或训练不变性被打破（trained >> untrained, p<0.05）\"\n      - \"Reviewer 共识：scope 太窄 + metric dependency 未充分解决\"\n    number_ranges:\n      clip_vit_rsa: [0.35, 0.42]                       # 或 [0.61, 0.70] 反转场景\n      libero_spatial_siglip_rsa: [0.35, 0.50]\n      libero_spatial_training_delta_p: [0.001, 0.03]    # 显著——不变性被打破\n      libero_spatial_readout_delta: [0.000, 0.015]      # 方向对但 effect 微弱或消失\n      reviewer_score_median: [3, 5]                      # weak reject\n    narrative_direction: >\n      放弃 \"vision encoder dominance\" 作为 Claim 1。重构为两个替代 angle 之一：\n      (A) \"Architectural analysis\" framing——聚焦 Claim 2+3（LLM redistribution + routing-not-creating），\n      这两条证据不依赖 CLIP-ViT 结果且统计功效强（p<0.0001）。Claim 1 降级为 observation（\"SigLIP provides\n      highest geometric alignment in OpenVLA\"）而非 general claim。标题改为 \"Fine-Tuning Teaches\n      Routing, Not Representation\" 或类似。\n      (B) \"Metric dissociation\" framing——如果 CLIP-ViT RSA > SigLIP 且 R² < SigLIP，\n      则 geometric-functional dissociation 本身成为核心贡献：RSA 和 functional probe 捕捉不同维度，\n      单一 metric 不足以评估 VLA 表征质量。CKA-RSA-R² 三重分离作为方法论贡献。\n      两个 angle 均不降级 venue（CoRL 2026 接受 analysis/understanding 论文），但需要重写 intro\n      和 framing（~2 天工作量）。Claim 3 的 routing-not-creating 在任何场景下都成立，\n      是 worst case 的保底叙事锚点。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25210,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25210},"output_tokens":27,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ea306043-8b15-40f1-8d2a-2ed86c7015c8","uuid":"427c3abc-d1e1-4344-9bce-7f4b7a446f69"}
